      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Settlement began January 4, 1800, when David Nelson purchased 220,000 acres from the Antwerp Land Company, later subdivided by LeRay.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
