      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Theresa%2C_New_York",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Theresa’s first library opened in 1900, with the town hall leasing rooms to the Library Association for just $1 a year.",
